            <ArticleTitle>[Complications and side effects in patients with ischemic heart disease before coronary and ventricular radiography].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>35-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The author analyzes the reaction (myocardial ischemia, disorders of the cardiac rhythm and their associations) in 151 patients with ischemic heart disease immediately before the initiation of narcosis in patients undergoing coronary and ventricular radiography. Several disorders were revealed and measures on the prophylaxis and treatment of these disorders are proposed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
